## 4. COLOR SYSTEM

- Define tokens in `tailwind.config` (`primary`, `secondary`, `accent`,
  `background`, `surface`, `muted`, `border`) — never hardcode hex in
  components.
- Default: dark, near-black neutral base + exactly one saturated accent,
  unless the brief specifies an existing brand palette.
- Build/verify palettes with: **Coolors** (coolors.co) for generation,
  **Realtime Colors** (realtimecolors.com) for live UI preview, or
  **Radix Colors** (radix-ui.com/colors) for pre-built accessible scales
  with dark-mode pairs already solved.
- Maintain WCAG 2.1 AA+ contrast (4.5:1 body, 3:1 large text) even through
  glass/blur layers — test text-on-glass against the busiest background
  state, not the calmest one.

